    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nRESIDENTIAL SITE FOR SALE\n\nPlot B located to the rear of No. 26 Cluny Grove, Killiney, Co. Dublin. This generous site of 489sq.m has full planning permission (Dún Laoghaire-Rathdown Ref. D25A/0803/WEB for a contemporary 166sq.m two-storey three/four bedroom detached dwelling with well-proportioned living space.\n\nPositioned within the quiet cul de sac, the site offers a private setting which as part of the planning condition will have its own entrance, while retaining a separate parking and driveway for the existing residence.\n\nThe site enjoys a highly sought-after location in South County Dublin. Killiney Shopping Centre and the vibrant towns of Dalkey/Glasthule are nearby, offering an excellent selection of boutique shops, cafés, restaurants, and supermarkets. The DART station at Glenageary is approximately a 20-minute walk, while the No. 59 bus route is just five minutes away.\nA wealth of recreational amenities is nearby, including Killiney Hill Park, Fitzpatrick Castle Hotel, Killiney Golf Club, Cluny Park, Kilbogget Park and access to Cluny tennis Courts.\nThe M50 is easily accessible, providing swift connections to Dublin Airport and the national road network. The area is also renowned for its excellent selection of highly regarded schools, including Wyvern National School, Holy Child Killiney, Castle Park School, and Rathdown & St Joseph's of Cluny.\nPlanning Information\n\nFor full planning documentation, reports, and drawings, please see: \n\nhttps://planning.agileapplications.ie/dunlaoghaire/application-details/103909"
      },
